('professional', '¿Cuánto tiempo dedicas a tu desarrollo?', 'How much time do you dedicate to your development?', 'single_choice', '["0 horas", "1-2 horas", "3-5 horas", "6-10 horas", "Más de 10"]', '["0 hours", "1-2 hours", "3-5 hours", "6-10 hours", "More than 10"]', 2, 27),
